        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172850314?u=aaf2eb089887aefa3504cf5ec76dea0ab798282f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42676.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3789841764\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42676/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42676\">#42676</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds missing guidance to the tooltip role documentation explaining the correct ARIA pattern for implementing \"more info\" icons (ⓘ) with tooltips.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Changes</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Clarifies that the icon should be a <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;button&gt;</code> element, not have <code class=\"notranslate\">role=\"tooltip\"</code></li>\n<li>Provides example for simple tooltips using <code class=\"notranslate\">aria-describedby</code></li>\n<li>Provides example for complex content using <code class=\"notranslate\">role=\"dialog\"</code></li>\n<li>Explains key distinctions between proper and improper usage</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This addresses the confusion raised in the linked issue and referenced Stack Overflow discussion about the correct ARIA role for info icons.</p>",
