        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44868357?u=096bd31a657e3fc94f4821b3b53e251c7c1d07f6&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updates the Chinese calendar example in <code class=\"notranslate\">Temporal.PlainDate.from()</code> documentation:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Corrects the comment about epoch year alignment (Chinese year 2021 = ISO year 2021)</li>\n<li>Fixes expected output: <code class=\"notranslate\">\"2021-08-08[u-ca=chinese]\"</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">\"-000616-08-12[u-ca=chinese]\"</code></li>\n<li>Adds Hebrew calendar example showing significant epoch year difference (5781 Hebrew = 2021 ISO)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Per <a href=\"https://tc39.es/proposal-intl-era-monthcode/#table-epoch-years\" rel=\"nofollow\">TC39 proposal</a>, the Chinese calendar's epoch is ISO year 0, not -616 BCE.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #42565.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3766212609\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42565\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/42565/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42565\">#42565</a></p>\n\n\n",
